			"Message": "docs(Echo): Correct contribution guide and changelog links to tree paths\n\nFix the Markdown links for the Contribution Guide and Changelog in the README.md to use the `tree` path instead of `blob`. The previous `blob` links were pointing to incorrect paths that would result in 404 errors when accessing the `Current` branch on GitHub.\n\nThis ensures contributors can successfully navigate to the `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `CHANGELOG.md` files via the corrected `tree` URLs, maintaining documentation accessibility.",
